OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny intervals and a
OL,6,Ffew showers, these showers more
OL,7,Ffrequent over Dumfries and Galloway,
OL,8,Fwith the best of the sunshine towards
OL,9,FBerwickshire and East Lothian.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FFurther showers will continue
OL,12,Fthis evening and tonight, more
OL,13,Ffrequent over Dumfries and Galloway,
OL,14,Ffewer in the eastern Borders. Windy.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FA cloudier day with more
OL,17,Ffrequent showers, some on the heavy
OL,18,Fside, best of the sunnier spells
OL,19,Ftowards East Lothian. Strong westerly
OL,20,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
